    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μον-άμπυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠκος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, of horses,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having one frontlet</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονάμπυκες πῶλοι</span> horses
				<i>that run single, race</i>-horses, opp. chariots, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				428
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονάμπυκες</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				586
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				680
			</span></i>; of a bull, <i>having no yoke-fellow</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονάμπυκος </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ον</span> codd.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήχων δέρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1567
				</span></i>
			.</div>
